  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello! I know this will be viewed in much contrast with so many posts here requesting same language only features but as someone who mainly plays VRC for language learning purposes, I always felt like it would be of great help if you could use fluency tags (i.e. beginner, intermediate, advanced, native) in each language so people would see them and start a conversation about how they can help them or, if they're both learning the same language, how they want to become language partners, etc etc.\n\nMuch as language is the biggest dividing factor in VRC, I think this will lead to benefitting people who are more interested in connecting with people from different parts of the world. This is also an observation made after talking to a lot of my fellow asian people who predominantly speak KR/JP. Thanks~!",
